Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.54,0:00:03.00,text1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\alpha&H11\fscx95\fscy85\blur0.6\shad0\fsp-1.5\c&HFBFEFF&\pos(997.5,942)}November 1st, 2024   1st Floor • Town of Beginnings
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.93,0:00:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's so many of them, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.65,0:00:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.73,0:00:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like this pretty much every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.41,0:00:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, is Yui feeling any better?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.13,0:00:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, she got a good night's\Nsleep, so I think she's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.07,0:00:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, you tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.15,0:00:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has this ever happened to her before?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.37,0:00:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.27,0:00:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, we found her on floor\N22, wandering in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.63,0:00:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.09,0:00:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's lost her memory. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.01,0:00:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the reason we came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.47,0:00:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We thought maybe someone in the town\Nof Beginnings might know who she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.25,0:00:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.17,0:00:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen her before?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.77,0:00:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.09,0:00:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, there are a lot of kids\Nin town, but I've never seen her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.05,0:01:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the game started, a lot of the children\Nsuffered severe psychological trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.95,0:01:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't stand by and do nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.03,0:01:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I moved to this church and made\Nit a safe place for them to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.15,0:01:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I walk through the town every\Nday looking for kids like these,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.53,0:01:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kids who might need my help, but in all\Nthis time, I've never seen her before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.21,0:01:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to square one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.81,0:01:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you. I'm Yulier.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.05,0:01:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're with the army, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.01,0:01:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're not here to start\Ntrouble because of yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.89,0:01:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, I'm here to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.59,0:01:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did right by putting\Nthose men in their place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.83,0:01:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I came here to ask\Nthe two of you for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.49,0:01:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
