Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.41,0:03:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was formed, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.65,0:03:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well, actually, it was\Nour leader, Thinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.49,0:03:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He never wanted it to turn into the kind\Nof dictatorial organization it's become.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.97,0:03:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At first,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.91,0:03:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the mission of the guild was\Nto share information and food,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.71,0:03:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,equally, among as many\Nplayers as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.11,0:03:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then the guild grew\Ntoo large, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.77,0:03:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.68,0:03:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after much infighting,\None man became very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.79,0:03:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.55,0:03:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,name is Gabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.46,0:03:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabe and his group became\Nstronger and stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.13,0:03:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,monopolizing all the best\Nmonster spawn points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.71,0:03:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're out of control now,\Nextorting other players under
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.75,0:03:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the pretext of collecting taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.35,0:03:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was obvious Gabe didn't\Ncare about clearing the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.85,0:04:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that made a lot of people mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.29,0:04:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had to do something to get\Nback in their good graces,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he sent the highest level\Nplayers he had to the front lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.41,0:04:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kovats!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.27,0:04:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabe was denounced after\Nspearheading that massacre.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.57,0:04:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when we started to seriously\Nconsider kicking him out of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.25,0:04:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the guild for good and now that\Nhe's scared and getting desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.75,0:04:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's decided to eliminate thinker he set a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.35,0:04:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trap and stranded thinker\Ndeep inside a dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.13,0:04:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't he teleport out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.45,0:04:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,does he have any weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.01,0:04:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he didn't take anything with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.43,0:04:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gibao told him he wanted\Nto talk unarmed thinker
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.11,0:04:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believed him. That was three days\Nago. He's been gone that long?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.37,0:04:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't he find his way out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.89,0:04:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dungeon is the highest\Nlevel we've seen so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.73,0:04:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't get out of there on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.17,0:04:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As his second-in-command, this is my
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.07,0:04:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.98,0:05:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the problem is, my level\Nisn't high enough to reach him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.45,0:05:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Gabe is using his influence to keep\Nthe rest of the army from helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.25,0:05:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I heard that two of the most powerful\Nplayers anyone's seen were in town,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.73,0:05:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought, this is my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.39,0:05:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tracked you down\Nbecause I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.75,0:05:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, Asuna, I beg you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.53,0:05:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for Thinker's sake, please help\Nme rescue him from that dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.59,0:05:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think we can help get Thinker\Nout of there, we'd be glad to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.75,0:05:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, well, the thing is, we'd like\Nto make sure you're telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.67,0:05:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I know we just met\Nand I'm asking a lot from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.79,0:05:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when I think about him trapped alone\Nin there, I feel like I'm going insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.53,0:05:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.41,0:05:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything she's been\Ntelling you is the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.05,0:05:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Y-Yui, you mean you can tell? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how I know\Nshe is, but she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.59,0:06:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything, I'd rather trust her and\Nregret it than not trust her and regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.05,0:06:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.05,0:06:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll all work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.73,0:06:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.23,0:06:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you say, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.67,0:06:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easygoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.47,0:06:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.65,0:06:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hope we're strong enough to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.13,0:06:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.93,0:06:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what it feels like\Nto want to save someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.87,0:06:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially someone you care for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.95,0:06:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay here and wait for us, okay? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.43,0:06:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.77,0:06:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.15,0:06:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to stay here with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.81,0:06:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, now we get to\Nsee her rebellious side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.85,0:06:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.37,0:06:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous for you to\Ncome along with us this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.45,0:06:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going too!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.69,0:06:52.20,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(630,450)\fsp-3\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H2E342F&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H091E1C&}1st Floor • Starting Town  Black Iron Castle
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.69,0:06:52.20,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(630,450)\fsp-3\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H2E342F&\blur3\fs72\alpha&15}1st Floor • Starting Town  Black Iron Castle
Dialogue: 2,0:06:48.69,0:06:52.20,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(630,450)\fscx95\fscy85\shad0\pos(960,942)\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&\fsp-3}1st Floor • Starting Town  Black Iron Castle
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.31,0:06:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never knew this dungeon was under\Nthe Town of Beginnings. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.73,0:06:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There wasn't anything like\Nthis during the beta test.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.91,0:07:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the dungeon opens up to reveal\Nmore as the floors above are cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.11,0:07:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet Gabe was planning on\Nkeeping this place all to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.15,0:07:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exclusive access to\Nspawns can be profitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.93,0:07:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, the monsters here\Nare usually around level 60.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.95,0:07:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't be able to do much hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.93,0:07:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.79,0:07:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.01,0:07:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.55,0:07:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, she's a heck\Nof a lot tougher than she looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.53,0:07:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll make a fine Swordsman someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.55,0:07:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.71,0:08:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I should apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.89,0:08:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's doing all the fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.57,0:08:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, he's happy out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.33,0:08:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, he loves getting his battle on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.51,0:08:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're pretty far down,\Nare we almost there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.61,0:08:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thinker hasn't moved from\Nthis position for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.49,0:08:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could be a safe zone, but I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.57,0:08:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can reach it, maybe we\Ncan use a teleport crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.57,0:08:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whew!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.48,0:08:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I fought my butt off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.71,0:08:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have helped you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.97,0:08:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.97,0:08:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.17,0:08:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, they dropped some items.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.89,0:08:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.80,0:08:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get anything good?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.33,0:08:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.79,0:08:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.79,0:08:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's scavenged toad meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.31,0:08:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean those frogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.67,0:08:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, the weirder the meat,\Nthe better the taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.93,0:08:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you can cook it up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.61,0:08:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not on your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.39,0:08:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.87,0:08:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, what'd you do that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it. Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.73,0:08:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do with these?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.43,0:08:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.34,0:08:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no! Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.65,0:09:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get rid of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.43,0:09:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.85,0:09:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just have to pull this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.81,0:09:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.93,0:09:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never ever seen you smile before!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.21,0:09:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's a safe zone
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.69,0:09:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a player inside
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Thinker! Wait! Don't
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.29,0:09:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yulier!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.43,0:09:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thinker!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.71,0:09:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.67,0:09:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The corridor's rigged!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.13,0:10:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop! Wait, Yulia! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.43,0:10:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yulia, take her to the safe area\Nand wait for us there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.37,0:10:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.13,0:10:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.95,0:10:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, use the Teleport Crystal and\Nget Yui and the others out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.01,0:10:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see its data with my ID skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.47,0:10:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could be as strong as\Nsomething from Floor 90.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.97,0:10:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can buy you time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.27,0:11:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just get everyone out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.77,0:11:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way am I leaving you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.53,0:11:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.93,0:11:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.19,0:11:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care of Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.65,0:11:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run while you still have a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.47,0:11:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna! No! We can't leave! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.79,0:11:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yui, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.68,0:11:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.97,0:12:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.47,0:12:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from it! Huey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.05,0:12:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy, Mommy, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.41,0:12:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.69,0:12:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An immortal object.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.13,0:12:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.07,0:13:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.07,0:13:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yui? Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.97,0:13:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.13,0:13:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.61,0:13:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yui, say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.25,0:13:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You remember who you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.63,0:13:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.31,0:14:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything in the world of Sword Art\NOnline is controlled by a single,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.27,0:14:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,massive system.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.55,0:14:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The system is called Cardinal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.15,0:14:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was designed to operate entirely on\Nits own, without any human intervention.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.41,0:14:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its function is to regulate the balance\Nof SAO according to its own discretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.13,0:14:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From monsters and NPC AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.11,0:14:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to drop rates for items and money,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.09,0:14:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything here is controlled by the\Nprocesses the Cardinal Program executes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.67,0:14:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That includes the psychological\Ncare of the players.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.99,0:14:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mental Health Counseling\NProgram Prototype 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.29,0:14:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Codename Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.43,0:14:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.91,0:14:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a program?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.27,0:14:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An AI?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.27,0:14:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was designed to put\Nplayers at ease with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.29,0:14:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I was given the ability\Nto emulate complex emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.69,0:15:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing about me is real,\Nnothing not even my tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.15,0:15:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.83,0:15:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then what about your amnesia?\NCan that happen to an AI?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.89,0:15:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.57,0:15:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on the day of the official launch,\Nand for reasons I never understood,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.13,0:15:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Cardinal program banned me from\Ninteracting with any of the players.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.87,0:15:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't allowed to assist them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.15,0:15:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't do anything except continue\Nmonitoring their mental states.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.09,0:15:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their situation, in a word, was horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.61,0:15:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terror. Despair. Rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.13,0:15:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People were overcome by negative feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.65,0:15:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some of them couldn't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.73,0:15:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They went insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.35,0:16:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Under normal circumstances,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.53,0:16:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my function would have been to\Ngo to such players immediately,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.35,0:16:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I wasn't permitted\Nany contact with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.41,0:16:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little by little, errors began piling\Nup inside of me, and I fell apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.73,0:16:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, one day, I saw two players.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.67,0:16:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their mental parameters\Nwere vastly different
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.75,0:16:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from anything I'd seen among the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.31,0:16:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was joy, and peace,\Nand there was something more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.95,0:16:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wandered through the playing field,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.19,0:16:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hoping to get as close to\Nboth of you as I could,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.15,0:16:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without being detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.47,0:16:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, that's why you were in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.33,0:16:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.15,0:16:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've wanted to meet the two\Nof you for the longest time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.91,0:16:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's strange, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.59,0:16:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be impossible for\Nme to think things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.25,0:17:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not human, I'm a program after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.03,0:17:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yui, maybe what you're feeling\Nare real human emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.89,0:17:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.29,0:17:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.39,0:17:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.75,0:17:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.11,0:17:23.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You aren't just some program anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.51,0:17:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The system can't control you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.61,0:17:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, if you want something,\Nall you have to do is say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.73,0:17:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, tell us what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.09,0:17:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.49,0:17:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to stay with you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.59,0:17:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.23,0:17:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.01,0:17:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.81,0:17:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be together forever, Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.13,0:18:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, remember, you're our child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.45,0:18:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.71,0:18:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.51,0:18:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.53,0:18:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is actually a console the GM can use\Nto gain emergency access to the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.63,0:18:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used it to delete the\Nmonster in the corridor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.09,0:18:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, because I disobeyed\Nthe Cardinal's directive,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.45,0:18:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the system is running\Na check on my program.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.47,0:18:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It thinks I'm a foreign object now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.31,0:18:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll probably be deleted at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.75,0:18:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.99,0:18:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a way around it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.99,0:18:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy, Mommy, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.43,0:18:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.11,0:18:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.17,0:18:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.11,0:18:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.15,0:19:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.51,0:19:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just started living like a real family!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.51,0:19:05.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yui, don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.27,0:19:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever the two of you are around,\Nyou have a way of making people smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.29,0:19:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, and for me,\Nplease continue my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.79,0:19:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep helping people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.37,0:19:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Share your happiness with all\Nof them. I can't. I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.09,0:19:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.93,0:19:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't be happy without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.73,0:19:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smile, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.61,0:20:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cardinal! No! Kayaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.03,0:20:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna find out things don't\Nalways go the way you want them to!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.47,0:20:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.07,0:20:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm fast enough, I might be able to\Nuse the GM's account to access the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.45,0:20:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.85,0:20:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.35,0:20:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The system was about to reject\NYui's admin credentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.07,0:20:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing I could do was take her\Nprogram and turn it into a game object.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.47,0:20:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, this is…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.29,0:20:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're holding Yui's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.25,0:21:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.93,0:21:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the game does get\Ncleared, and this world ends…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.07,0:21:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen to Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.73,0:21:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
