Dialogue: 2,0:21:16.77,0:21:20.23,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\shad0\pos(960,942)\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&\fscx110}22{\fscx95}nd Floor • Coral
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.77,0:21:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fixed it so her data will be saved\Nto the local memory on my nerve gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.51,0:21:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we get back, recreating her the\Nway she was isn't going to be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.15,0:21:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if there's a way, we'll find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.35,0:21:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.26,0:21:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as we can be a family again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.01,0:21:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see her when we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.19,0:21:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our first child.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.07,0:21:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'll see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.07,0:21:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.13,0:21:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.55,0:22:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Mommy
